1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
The parcel was waiting at the wrong door.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,340
Nora checked the label, then looked across the hall.

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,860
The number matched the apartment opposite.

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,420
She carried the parcel over and knocked.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,820
For a moment, nothing happened.

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:16,600
Then the door opened, and an anxious neighbor smiled.

7
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:19,000
He had been waiting all morning.

8
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,240
Nora handed it over and stepped back.

9
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,840
A small mistake had taken only a minute to fix.

10
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,700
When she returned home, the hallway was quiet again.

11
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:33,600
This time, the parcel was exactly where it belonged.
